_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0b4b1379/uploads/origins/25d0c262-ad61-4be4-9216-092d3c2d058e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52a91bf6fac5e908eb65a62ff785db12, https://si.imgix.net/0b4b1379/uploads/origins/25d0c262-ad61-4be4-9216-092d3c2d058e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78c8997c40dcca5b0896eca32f2c728a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0b4b1379/uploads/origins/25d0c262-ad61-4be4-9216-092d3c2d058e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5cc07c8a7d7f3b72a5eb0727a0d201a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I'm super in love with your art style. I'd love to have you draw my character! Here are some details, he is a retired civil engineer that now works as a winemaker. His personality is humble and tranquil. His references will be attached in the url below. \n\nFor this occasion, since some time has passed, I'd like a slight hairstyle change, which you can ultimately decide upon. Maybe an inch longer and pulled back so as to not cover his face, for example with either a small manbun or using accessories like a headband.\nI'd also like an outfit change to something with more warm beige colours whilst evoking the feeling of a farmer. The time period is in 1910s, hope that'll give some ideas.\nI was hoping for a full body illustration, but if you're tight on time, down to the knees is also okay! \nFeel free to use any pose you see fit! \n\nThis is my first time requesting on skeb so bear with me. Thank you for considering!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mJyotxAbziUjp4TGWis54ruOuRelISMA?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@the_world_g25/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/35503ac1/uploads/origins/8ed34036-2f1d-4a13-b998-48f7c082206f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRI