y original characters? They are a couple. \n\nThe girl is active and mischievous, with a slightly darker color on the ears and the top side of the tail.\nThe male is an adult elf with a cold personality and short elf ears. He is strong and reliable. He does not show his emotions very much, but their relationship is very good. He always took care of her and he generally indulges her. His hair is a gradation of white to light blue. There is no need to draw armor or weapons.\n\nThere are a few costume designs, feel free to choose the one you like between \"衣装01,03,04,06,07\".\nFor poses, I'd like to see  “壁ドン” , and the girl's expression is flustered and shy, and the guy feels slightly nervous. (They can also be hiding from something else, and the man looks elsewhere) Or funny moments, like the man is dragging her to leave but she doesn't want to, or any other interactions you want! \n\nThanks for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hElIblSGYEBRuWEN8oq0dpdD1Ue327Ix?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@the_world_g25/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c9707261/uploads/origins/da4ce172-f785-4953-821b-9395c4a84523?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c80b4ad8be68c4e63a6ba812c3a3e16d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c9707261/uploads/origins/da4ce172-f785-4953-821b-9395c4a84523?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c80b4ad8be68c4e63a6ba812c3a3e16d, https://si.imgix.net/c9707261/uploads/origins/da4ce172-f785-4953-821b-9395c4a84523?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7130143af84b1c4b4ee4bd43c89605b3 2x, https://